cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l7h6qQWVQM0Q7kNvwFjuqBb&_nc_oc=AdpcLOkCqDLbvAGnHoaXM-bTEjzAINxFUNbvRhkYDLLY4_acvCTrTXF6OaiEhklSm2Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHksBCQrpzPpV2yTF4gvKvxd0EJ0T8_JAl3zUeRkiccIw&oe=6A8ED76F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "S-Calculator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "A stylish, simple, and easy-to-use calculator with a hidden feature\n\nA stylish calculator app with a design based on black.\nWe have simply gathered the functions needed for daily calculations, pursuing true ease of use.\n\n[Main Features]\n\u30fbBasic Functions: Arithmetic operations (+, -, \u00d7, \u00f7), percentage calculations, and sign switching (+/-).\n\u30fbUsability: Equipped with haptic feedback (vibration) when buttons are pressed.\n\u30fbDesign: Uses an eye-friendly dark mode and a highly readable programming font.\n\u30fbPrecision: Supports input of up to 15 digits, designed to minimize calculation errors.\n\n[Hidden Feature]\nTired of calculating? How about a little break?\nIf you tap the \"=\" button 5 times rapidly while in the initial state (when \"0\" is displayed), a hidden game mode will launch.\nPlease enjoy a simple yet engrossing side-scrolling action game.\n(Game Controls: Jump with \"0\", Return to calculator with \"AC\")\n\nMaking daily calculations a little more fun.\nWe hope you download and make use of it.", "short_description": "A stylish calculator designed in black. It distills daily functions into simplicity, created with a focus on pure usability."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://lubyte.net/s-dentaku-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-service/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://lubyte.net/s-dentaku-privacy-policy-and-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Lubyte", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://lubyte.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "c